  "description": "Eclaire Banoffi is a rich dessert-inspired gourmand fragrance that blends creamy banana sweetness with caramelized accords and smooth vanilla warmth. The scent feels playful, cozy, and indulgent, inspired by the comforting aroma of banana toffee desserts. The opening introduces ripe banana and sweet creamy accords, creating a warm and delicious first impression that feels soft and addictive. The heart develops into caramel and gourmand notes, adding richness and a dessert-like sweetness with smooth depth. The base settles into vanilla, musk, and creamy woods, leaving a warm, cozy, and long-lasting trail that feels comforting and luxurious. Eclaire Banoffi is perfect for those who enjoy sweet edible-style fragrances with creamy banana warmth and rich gourmand depth.",
